380 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 196 0 R
/T (During the autonomous cutting of tomatoes we often face the problem with the cutting end effector. These systems usually rely on point cloud visual data to identify the cutting point. These points often have discrepancies, leading to inaccuracies in the exact position of the cutting point. This can result in incomplete cuts or damage to the fruit itself. )
/E (During the autonomous cutting of tomatoes we often face the problem with the cutting end effector. These systems usually rely on point cloud visual data to identify the cutting point. These points often have discrepancies, leading to inaccuracies in the exact position of the cutting point. This can result in incomplete cuts or damage to the fruit itself. )
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
381 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 196 0 R
/T (Thus we need to have a hook mechanism which pulls out the pedicel from a zone of possibilities of occurrence as per the detected cutting point. Existing tools and automated systems also often lack the capability to securely pull and stabilize the pedicel during cutting, which is crucial for ensuring a clean and precise cut.)
/E (Thus we need to have a hook mechanism which pulls out the pedicel from a zone of possibilities of occurrence as per the detected cutting point. Existing tools and automated systems also often lack the capability to securely pull and stabilize the pedicel during cutting, which is crucial for ensuring a clean and precise cut.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
